
# --- 256-color overrides (light only) ----------------------------------------
# Some programs pick from the 256-color palette, whose light entries are made
# for dark backgrounds (~1.0-1.4:1 contrast on light grey, i.e. invisible).
# Remap the common ones to ink versions of the same hue (all >= 4.5:1).
color67  #3d5578
color75  #2b4a75
color76  #0b5c2c
color81  #24566b
color87  #1f5c5c
color113 #2c5e3d
color116 #2c5655
